OL,3,AMeta's $18bn settlement may hasten
OL,4,Areckoning for social media on child
OL,5,Asafety
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeta's decision to agree to an $18bn
OL,8,F(#13.3bn) settlement on Wednesday, to
OL,9,Fresolve claims that Facebook and
OL,10,FInstagram harmed children, came as a
OL,11,Fsurprise.
OL,13,FI was expecting weeks of courtroom
OL,14,Fdrama as 29 states ` almost two-thirds
OL,15,Fof America - took on one US tech giant.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
