OL,3,AMeta's $18bn settlement may hasten
OL,4,Areckoning for social media on child
OL,5,Asafety
OL,6,
OL,7,FTechnically, the trial was about
OL,8,Fchildren's online privacy. It was based
OL,9,Fon a US law called the Children's
OL,10,FOnline Privacy Protection Act (COPPA),
OL,11,Fwhich is nearly 30 years old and
OL,12,Fpredates all of today's biggest social
OL,13,Fplatforms.
OL,15,FIt centred around Meta's historic
OL,16,Fgathering and use of data belonging to
OL,17,Fchildren under the age of 13 over a
OL,18,Fperiod of several years.
